"""Publish the reviewed Atlas release as a root-owned, versioned trust anchor.

This is the physical TOFU enrollment and three pinned corrective reconciliation
steps.  It never accepts credentials, does not publish a bootstrap marker, and
does not start or alter any service.
"""

